DMC Thread Color Data in dmc.csv

The DMC thread color data included in this software is based on the "DMC Thread Colors" dataset by Jon McLoone, published in the Wolfram Data Repository in 2022.

Source:
https://datarepository.wolframcloud.com/resources/JonMcLoone_DMC-Thread-Colors/

The source dataset describes its color data as being derived from the perceptual average of three independent sources:

- camelia.sk
- 123stitch.com
- Adrian J.'s CrossStitchCreator project

Source of the DMC thread information:
https://www.dmc.com/

This notice identifies the source and provenance of the DMC thread color data included in dmc.csv. The DMC name and related product identifiers are associated with their respective rights holders.